<title>SINGAPORE: Intraco 1H net down 18.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Intraco 1H net down 18.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     6.58	  vs    8.04</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	    6.82	  vs    8.33</p>
<p>    Turnover			322.08	 vs   450.21</p>
<p>    Dividend income		 0.78	 vs     0.78</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest 0.67	 vs     1.14</p>
<p>    Interest expense		1.74	 vs     1.69</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    1.91	 vs     1.07</p>
<p>    Net profits from associates 4.09	 vs     3.23</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 10.59	 vs    12.87</p>
<p>    Tax				 3.38	 vs     3.59</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)	     0.63	 vs     1.23</p>
<p>NOTE - Intraco Ltd is a diversified group with more than 30 subsidiaries. Its core businesses include automobiles, commodities, engineering and telecommunications.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
